# Wave 335: daily-run diagnostic logs MUST commit despite *.log above --
# confirmed 2026-08-03 that daily-stdout, daily-failures, reel-fires,
# higgsfield-download-runs, office-history-runs, and cartoon-posts had ZERO
# commits ever (git log --all -- <dir> returns nothing) despite their
# workflows explicitly tee-ing/copying a .log file and running git add on
# it every single run. Root cause: git add on a path matched by the
# blanket *.log rule above silently no-ops (no error), so every
# "git diff --cached --quiet || commit" check always took the "nothing to
# commit" branch. Same failure mode Wave 191b/193/236 already fixed for
# cartoon-runs/higgsfield-upload-runs/editorial-panel -- extending the same
# pattern to the remaining log-writing audit dirs discovered this session.
!audits/daily-stdout/
!audits/daily-stdout/**
!audits/daily-failures/
!audits/daily-failures/**
!audits/reel-fires/
!audits/reel-fires/**
!audits/higgsfield-download-runs/
!audits/higgsfield-download-runs/**
!audits/office-history-runs/
!audits/office-history-runs/**
!audits/cartoon-posts/
!audits/cartoon-posts/**
